    "title": "Saturday arts and fitness classes in Kingston",
    "text": "21 hours ago Center for Creative Education at 16 Cedar Street, Kingston is offering two 10:30 AM Saturday classes: ARTS & MOVEMENT for ages 5–9 (art, music, dance, and play) and DXF – Dance Xross Fitness with Drew for adults (dance, kickboxing, strength training, and soul line dance). Each class is $22 drop-in or included with monthly unlimited memberships, with sliding scale and scholarships available; carry sneakers in, as no outside shoes are allowed in the dance studios. Register through the CCE4ME app or at cce4me.org .\nThis content is adapted from materials provided by Center for Creative Education - Arts with a purpose\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.",
